<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16330" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσμενος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-pleased, glad,</i> always with a Verb, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύγεν ἄ. ἐκ θανάτοιο</span> he was <i>glad
				to</i> have escaped death, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				20.350
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.74
			</span></i>: freq. in Trag. and 
				Att.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσμενος δὲ τἂν . . κάμψειεν γόνυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					398
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ θαλάσσης ἀσμένους πεφευγότας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					398
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. αἱρεθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκάθευδον ἄ. ἥκων ἐξ ἀγροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					1.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσμένας εἰς τὸν λειμῶνα ἀπιούσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					614e
				</span></i>
			: freq. in dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμοὶ δέ κεν
				ἀσμένῳ εἴη</span>
			<i>glad</i> would it make me ! <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.108
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσμένῳ δέ σοι . . νὺξ
				ἀποκρύψει φάος</span>
			<i>glad</i> wilt thou be when night shuts out the light, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥς σφι ἀσμένοισι ἡμέρα ἐπέλαμψε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσμένῃ δέ μοι . . ἦλθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἀσμένοισιν ἦλθες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					582
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				418c
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσμένως</span>”
				<i>gladly, readily,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					728
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				142
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Timocl.
				14
			</span></i> (this Adv., which is common in later Greek, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				21.17
			</span></i>, etc., has sts. been substituted for the Adj., as
			in <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.21
			</span></i> (v. l.)): 
				Sup.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσμεναίτατα</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				329c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				616a
			</span></i> (though the Adj. makes <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερος, -ώτατος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.18B.
			</span></i>). (Not to be connected with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁνδάνω,</span> since there is no ancient authority for rough
			breathing <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁσμ-.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
